Z||000012||Standard||02-25-2001||09:04 PM||||I get frost on all my windows.  The biggest problem with the rear window that I've noticed is it fogs up for the first about 10 minutes of driving.  The rear defrost really helps with that.  It seems I'm the only one here that actually uses rear defrost and nobody believes that I need it, but trust me it helps.  ||||reg||1
